    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In a top-secret government experiment, a squad of the most highly trained and highly fashionable operatives in the world are sent through a newly discovered interstellar gate. Instead of finding advanced technology, they land in a world of medieval kingdoms, powerful sorcery, and deadly ninja cults serving an evil warlord.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/f5dd1048a90e40c45b394252cc11c4c0.webp?t=1753905078\" width=600 height=39 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/f81547899a1a1cb49505c0f384ba47e3.poster.avif?t=1753905078\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/f81547899a1a1cb49505c0f384ba47e3.webm?t=1753905078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/f81547899a1a1cb49505c0f384ba47e3.mp4?t=1753905078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, the focus is on intense, fast-paced tactical combat rather than resource gathering or base management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no distractions from building structures or managing resources, the action remains relentless, keeping you fully engaged in the thrill of combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/141ed9d2fcb5d9e58008610361bf9f97.webp?t=1753905078\" width=600 height=39 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/fb7398dda66c49ac73a547ab49567e44.poster.avif?t=1753905078\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/fb7398dda66c49ac73a547ab49567e44.webm?t=1753905078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/fb7398dda66c49ac73a547ab49567e44.mp4?t=1753905078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create visually striking avatars that suit your style.\u00a0High resolution character models and skin textures help bring your creations to life with depth and personality.\u00a0Experiment with hair styles and vibrant colors, or match your outfit to your favorite nail polish - every choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic breast and hair physics bring every movement to life, making your creations feel even more dynamic and alluring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've customized your character, you'll see them come to life throughout the game - including in its romantic and intimate moments. These scenes reflect your choices, letting you experience connections that feel personal and visually consistent with the character you've created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In a top-secret government experiment, a squad of the most highly trained and highly fashionable operatives in the world are sent through a newly discovered interstellar gate. Instead of finding advanced technology, they land in a world of medieval kingdoms, powerful sorcery, and deadly ninja cults serving an evil warlord.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/f5dd1048a90e40c45b394252cc11c4c0.webp?t=1753905078\" width=600 height=39 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/f81547899a1a1cb49505c0f384ba47e3.poster.avif?t=1753905078\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/f81547899a1a1cb49505c0f384ba47e3.webm?t=1753905078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/f81547899a1a1cb49505c0f384ba47e3.mp4?t=1753905078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, the focus is on intense, fast-paced tactical combat rather than resource gathering or base management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no distractions from building structures or managing resources, the action remains relentless, keeping you fully engaged in the thrill of combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/141ed9d2fcb5d9e58008610361bf9f97.webp?t=1753905078\" width=600 height=39 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/fb7398dda66c49ac73a547ab49567e44.poster.avif?t=1753905078\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/fb7398dda66c49ac73a547ab49567e44.webm?t=1753905078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632430/extras/fb7398dda66c49ac73a547ab49567e44.mp4?t=1753905078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create visually striking avatars that suit your style.\u00a0High resolution character models and skin textures help bring your creations to life with depth and personality.\u00a0Experiment with hair styles and vibrant colors, or match your outfit to your favorite nail polish - every choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic breast and hair physics bring every movement to life, making your creations feel even more dynamic and alluring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've customized your character, you'll see them come to life throughout the game - including in its romantic and intimate moments. These scenes reflect your choices, letting you experience connections that feel personal and visually consistent with the character you've created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A tactical turn-based game inspired by sleazy '80s/'90s B-movies. Lead gun-slinging bombshells through a portal to another world and battle dark sorcerers. Customize your characters, spark romances, and unwind at your HQ\u2019s strip club in this wild sci-fantasy adventure.",
